/target
# The UI harnesses build nested fixture crates under the crate they run from, so
# rstorch-derive/target appears whenever the derive suite runs. Its cleanup is
# skipped when the pinned-toolchain assertion panics first, which left an
# untracked directory that root-anchored /target does not cover.
target/
# `Cargo.lock` is committed: the trybuild UI expectations are pinned to a
# compiler version, so an upstream patch release must not be able to redden CI
# with no local change. The UI lanes run `--locked`.
/.test_cache
/data
.DS_Store
# The design record and the milestone baseline snapshots: working material,
# kept locally rather than carried in the history.
/docs
/test-tools
